    "title": "High Bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 days ago High Bridge Presbyterian celebrated worldwide communion and welcomed four new members into the church this past Sunday. The new members are Sandy Emore, Pam Lotts, and Bruce and Nellie Freit. We had one visitor, a member of the Virginia Military Institute rugby team. After the service, the congregation chose a nominating committee for elders and deacons for the class of 2028. The members of the committee are Mary Carson Worley, Linda Wood, Lea Braford, Faye Worley and Aaron Black. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
